---
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const crew = [
  { id: 'explorer', name: 'Explorer', role: 'A spark of courage', ability: 'Lantern Dash', detail: 'A quick burst in your facing direction. Find your footing before the next fall.' },
  { id: 'mossling', name: 'Mossling', role: 'A softer way down', ability: 'Leaf Glide', detail: 'Unfurl little leaf wings to slow a fall, then fold them away on landing.' },
  { id: 'tock', name: 'Tock', role: 'Small, steady, steadfast', ability: 'Iron Guard', detail: 'Brace against belts, wind and ice, and absorb one spike or vent hit.' },
  { id: 'lumen', name: 'Lumen', role: 'Follow the little lights', ability: 'Lantern Lure', detail: 'Call nearby relics and fragments toward your lantern with a gentle glow.' },
];
---
<PageLayout
  title="Little Light Below"
  eyebrow="KHC Originals · 光落深境"
  lead="A little courage. A long way down."
  description="Meet four little travelers in Little Light Below / 光落深境, a painted offline cave adventure in development for iOS and Android."
  image="/apps/little-light-below/icon.png"
  compact
>
  <section class="expedition" aria-label="Meet the expedition">
    <div class="intro">
      <img class="app-icon" src="/apps/little-light-below/icon.png" width="112" height="112" alt="A little lantern-lit explorer above a glowing cave" />
      <p class="status">In development · iPhone testing</p>
      <h2>Eight little lights.<br />One way home.</h2>
      <p>The Heart Lantern has gone quiet. Guide a little traveler through eight painted worlds, restore their beacons, and reconnect the light beneath the observatory. Bring warmth back to an underground home.</p>
      <p lang="zh-Hant">重燃八盞引路燈，接通深處的心燈。在手繪洞窟裡找到旅伴，為大家點亮回家的路。</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="primary" href="#crew">Meet the crew <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        <a href="/games/100-floor-descent/">Play the original browser edition <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="availability">Being built for iOS and Android. Store downloads are not available yet. The original browser edition is a separate game.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="phone">
      <img src="/apps/little-light-below/v170/home.webp" width="590" height="1278" alt="The actual iPhone home screen: a lantern-lit underground city and the expedition button" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption>On iPhone · version 1.7.0</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section id="crew" class="chapter" aria-labelledby="crew-title">
    <p class="kicker">Four travelers. Your little adventure.</p>
    <h2 id="crew-title">Meet your company below.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Every traveler is available from the start. Their abilities change how you approach a tricky landing; their outfits, lantern colors and footsteps are yours to choose.</p>
    <div class="crew-grid">
      {crew.map((member) => (
        <article class="crew-card">
          <img src={`/apps/little-light-below/${member.id}-portrait.webp`} width="256" height="256" alt={`${member.name}, a painted little cave traveler`} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <div><p class="role">{member.role}</p><h3>{member.name}</h3><p class="ability">{member.ability}</p><p>{member.detail}</p></div>
          <details class="motion-study"><summary>Watch {member.name} move &amp; cheer</summary><video controls playsinline preload="none" width="480" height="360" poster={`/apps/little-light-below/v170/${member.id}-motion.webp`} aria-label={`${member.name} walking, running and cheering in front, three-quarter, side and back views`}><source src={`/apps/little-light-below/v170/${member.id}-motion.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />Your browser does not support inline video.</video><p class="video-note">A Wardrobe study: gentle steps, bent elbows and a little wave.</p></details>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="heart-title">
    <p class="kicker">A home worth finding</p>
    <h2 id="heart-title">Leave the refuge a little brighter.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Each beacon brings something home: a garden, a workshop, a warm table, a little pool. Short relay trails lead to waiting wayfarers and optional memories. Reach the chapter beacon to keep your discoveries.</p>
    <div class="camp-pair">
      <figure><img src="/apps/little-light-below/v170/camp-0.webp" width="508" height="337" alt="The refuge before the guide lights return: a quiet stone terrace" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>A quiet beginning.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure><img src="/apps/little-light-below/v170/camp-8.webp" width="508" height="337" alt="The restored refuge with a garden, workshop, hearth, pool, star window and four travelers sharing a table" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>Eight guide lights. A place for everyone.</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <p class="video-note">Illustrated camp stages from the game.</p>
    <div class="heartwell-preview">
      <div><h3>One final connection.</h3><p>Beyond floor 160, the Heartwell brings runes, moving water, glass and wind into a ten-floor light puzzle. Restore three circuits and awaken the Heart Lantern. Every traveler can finish; relics are optional.</p><p>Story difficulty offers resting lights along the way. Adventure and Expert ask for an uninterrupted chapter. Collecting all 24 memories adds a constellation epilogue after the main ending.</p><p lang="zh-Hant">八盞信標之後，還有最後十層的心燈井。接通三條迴路，讓心燈醒來。主線結局不需要收集遺物；二十四段記憶，則會點亮可選的星空後日談。</p></div>
      <figure><video controls playsinline preload="none" width="420" height="600" poster="/apps/little-light-below/v170/heartwell.webp" aria-label="Heartwell gameplay excerpts: three light circuits and the Heart Lantern"><source src="/apps/little-light-below/v170/heartwell.mp4" type="video/mp4" />Your browser does not support inline video.</video><figcaption>Excerpts from a completed Heartwell route.</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
    <p class="kicker">One more landing</p>
    <h2 id="journey-title">A cave for every kind of day.</h2>
    <div class="features">
      <article><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Find your next world</h3><p>Follow the expedition through eight painted worlds, or drop into Arcade for a seeded Trial, a Daily course or a gentler descent.</p></article>
      <article><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Make the tricky bit yours</h3><p>Landing Coach can turn a failed footing into a short practice course at 80% pace, then take you back to retry the original run.</p></article>
      <article><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Follow your own lantern</h3><p>Lantern Echo can replay your successful Trial or Daily route as a little light to race. It stays local, and you choose when to show it.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="preview-title">
    <p class="kicker">A little look below · version 1.7.0</p>
    <h2 id="preview-title">Catch the next little landing.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">A glimpse of the opening world, with grounded steps, relaxed arm swings and gentle turns. Choose a traveler to watch a short gameplay preview.</p>
    <div class="gameplay-grid">
      {crew.map((member) => (
        <figure><video controls playsinline preload="none" width="420" height="600" poster={`/apps/little-light-below/v170/${member.id}-gameplay.webp`} aria-label={`${member.name} gameplay preview`}><source src={`/apps/little-light-below/v170/${member.id}-gameplay.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />Your browser does not support inline video.</video><figcaption>{member.name} · Lantern Gate</figcaption></figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <aside class="field-note">
    <div><p class="kicker">Made for a little escape</p><h2>Your expedition stays with you.</h2><p>Offline play, local progress, English and Traditional Chinese, optional sound and haptics, and reduced effects. No accounts, ads or in-app purchases.</p></div>
    <nav aria-label="App information"><a href="/games/little-light-below/support/">Help &amp; support →</a><a href="/games/little-light-below/privacy/">Privacy policy →</a></nav>
  </aside>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .expedition { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .7fr; align-items:center; gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,6rem); padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,4rem); border-radius:1.8rem; background:linear-gradient(125deg,#102f35,#071e29); color:#eee5cf; overflow:hidden; }
  .app-icon { border-radius:25%; box-shadow:0 12px 40px #0004; }
  .status,.kicker,.role { font-size:.75rem; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:650; }
  .status { color:#efc783; margin:1.6rem 0 1rem; }
  .intro h2 { color:#f5ecd4; font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,3.1rem); line-height:1.12; margin:0 0 1.4rem; letter-spacing:-.035em; }
  .intro p { max-width:36rem; line-height:1.7; }
  .intro p[lang] { color:#b3c8bf; font-size:.9rem; margin-top:1rem; }
  .actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem 1.5rem; align-items:center; margin:1.8rem 0; }
  .actions a { color:#f2cf91; font-size:.9rem; }
  .actions .primary { background:#e4bb78; color:#102f35; padding:.8rem 1rem; border-radius:.65rem; text-decoration:none; font-weight:650; }
  .intro .availability { color:#b3c8bf; font-size:.8rem; max-width:32rem; }
  .phone { margin:0; justify-self:center; max-width:270px; }
  .phone img { width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:1.6rem; box-shadow:0 24px 60px #0006; border:1px solid #dfbf7a55; }
  .phone figcaption { color:#b3c8bf; text-align:center; font-size:.75rem; margin-top:.9rem; }
  .chapter { margin:clamp(3rem,7vw,5.5rem) 0; scroll-margin-top:6rem; }
  .kicker { color:var(--color-muted); margin-bottom:.8rem; }
  .chapter h2,.field-note h2 { font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.1rem); letter-spacing:-.025em; margin-bottom:1rem; }
  .section-lead { max-width:44rem; color:var(--color-muted); line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:2rem; }
  .crew-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.2rem; }
  .crew-card { min-width:0; border:1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius:1rem; overflow:hidden; }
  .crew-card img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; background:#102b32; }
  .crew-card>div { padding:1.2rem; }
  .crew-card h3 { margin:.35rem 0 .5rem; font-size:1.35rem; }
  .role { font-size:.6rem; color:var(--color-muted); }
  .ability { font-size:.8rem; font-weight:650; margin-bottom:.6rem; }
  .crew-card p:last-child { font-size:.85rem; line-height:1.65; color:var(--color-muted); }
  .features { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:2rem; margin-top:2rem; }
  .features article>span { font-size:.8rem; color:var(--color-muted); }
  .features h3 { margin:.8rem 0; font-size:1.1rem; }
  .features p,.field-note p { color:var(--color-muted); line-height:1.7; }
  .motion-study { border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule); }
  .motion-study summary { cursor:pointer; padding:.9rem 1.2rem; font-size:.8rem; }
  .motion-study video { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; background:#142e37; }
  .motion-study .joy-video { max-width:192px; margin:0 auto; }
  .video-note { padding:.8rem 1rem; font-size:.75rem; color:var(--color-muted); }
  .camp-pair { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.2rem; }
  .camp-pair figure,.heartwell-preview figure { margin:0; min-width:0; }
  .camp-pair img { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:1rem; }
  .camp-pair figcaption,.heartwell-preview figcaption { color:var(--color-muted); font-size:.8rem; margin-top:.7rem; line-height:1.6; }
  .heartwell-preview { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr .7fr; align-items:center; gap:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,4rem); margin-top:2rem; padding:clamp(1.2rem,4vw,3rem); border:1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius:1.3rem; }
  .heartwell-preview h3 { font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem); margin:0 0 1rem; }
  .heartwell-preview p { color:var(--color-muted); line-height:1.8; margin:1rem 0; }
  .heartwell-preview p[lang] { font-size:.9rem; }
  .heartwell-preview video { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:1rem; background:#102b32; }
  .gameplay-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.2rem; }
  .gameplay-grid figure { min-width:0; margin:0; }
  .gameplay-grid video { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:1rem; background:#102b32; }
  .gameplay-grid figcaption { font-size:.8rem; color:var(--color-muted); margin-top:.8rem; }
  @media(max-width:800px) { .gameplay-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } }
  .field-note { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:3rem; border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule); padding:2.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .field-note>div { flex:1; max-width:42rem; }
  .field-note nav { display:grid; gap:1rem; flex-shrink:0; font-size:.9rem; }
  @media(max-width:800px) { .crew-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } .expedition { grid-template-columns:1fr .6fr; gap:1.5rem; } .field-note { align-items:flex-start; } }
  @media(max-width:580px) { .expedition,.heartwell-preview { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .phone { max-width:230px; margin-top:1rem; } .features,.camp-pair { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:1.6rem; } .heartwell-preview figure { max-width:280px; justify-self:center; } .field-note { flex-direction:column; gap:1.5rem; } .crew-grid { gap:.8rem; } .crew-card>div { padding:.9rem; } .role { letter-spacing:.04em; } }
</style>
